Package: stom-pi-vst3
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: stom-pi
Description: VST3 plugin bridge for Stom-Pi
 Provides the VST3-to-LV2 bridge tooling for the stom-pi pedalboard
 platform. Allows VST3 plugins to be loaded by mod-host as native LV2
 plugins with auto-generated control ports and modgui.
 .
 Includes a shared LV2 wrapper binary (vst3-wrapper.so) that is symlinked
 into generated LV2 bundles, and a scanner tool (stom-pi-vst3-scan) that
 introspects VST3 plugins and generates wrapper metadata.
